WEBVTT

NOTE Machine translated from English captions; target=rw.

1
00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:10.822
Catrat nimpamvu ikunze gutera ubuhumyi bushobora kuvurwa kwisi yose.

2
00:00:10.822 --> 00:00:18.917
Ni ngombwa gushobora gusuzuma umurwayi no kwemeza icyateye catrat ivurwa.

3
00:00:18.917 --> 00:00:24.155
Tangira ubaza niba cyclose yagiye gahoro gahoro cyangwa gitunguranye.

4
00:00:24.155 --> 00:00:31.774
Niba ijisho rimwe cyangwa byombi bigira ingaruka, kandi niba hari ububabare cyangwa ubushake.

5
00:00:31.774 --> 00:00:36.060
Ibikurikira, gerageza kureba neza intera no muri A.

6
00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:41.060
Koresha pinhole kugirango umenye neza ko kubura ibirahure atariyo mpamvu.

7
00:00:41.060 --> 00:00:43.060
Noneho reba imboni y'ijisho.

8
00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:47.060
Birabura, bizengurutse kandi bingana?

9
00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:49.060
Ese bakira umucyo?

10
00:00:49.060 --> 00:00:54.060
Niba ufite urumuri rwinshi, reba niba imboni y'ijisho agabanutse.

11
00:00:54.060 --> 00:00:59.060
Muri cataracte yateye imbere, imboni y'ijisho arashobora kugaragara cyera.

12
00:00:59.060 --> 00:01:04.060
Ndetse no muri cataracte, imboni y'ijisho agomba gukomeza kwitwara kumucyo.

13
00:01:04.060 --> 00:01:11.060
Suzuma imbere yijisho neza hamwe na acolyte cyangwa nibikoresho runaka.

14
00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:17.060
Reba neza ko ntakindi kibi kijyanye nijisho, cyane cyane inkovu ya cornea.

15
00:01:17.060 --> 00:01:24.060
Hamwe na acolyte, urashobora kandi kugenzura refleks yumuhondo cyangwa reindefundal.

16
00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:28.060
Mu jisho rifite cataracte, hashobora kubaho ibibara byijimye.

17
00:01:28.060 --> 00:01:32.380
Ibishishwa byabuze cyangwa bidahari rwose, ureba

18
00:01:32.380 --> 00:01:36.700
umwijima cyangwa se umweru muri cataracte ikuze.

19
00:01:36.700 --> 00:01:41.872
Niba iyerekwa ari ribi kandi flex ya fanroly isa neza, noneho harashobora

20
00:01:41.872 --> 00:01:42.980
kuba izindi mpamvu

21
00:01:42.980 --> 00:01:45.020
kubura intumbero.

22
00:01:45.020 --> 00:01:50.500
Ibi bikunze kugaragara cyane niba imboni y'ijisho atagabanije kumurika.

23
00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:56.100
Kwipimisha inyuma yijisho bizafasha gukangura ibitagenda neza.

24
00:01:56.100 --> 00:02:02.220
Hashobora kubaho ikibazo cyumutima wa optique cyangwa retina cyangwa byombi.

25
00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:08.144
Imitsi irashobora kugira icyuho kinini kubera glaucoma cyangwa igahuzwa kuva

26
00:02:08.144 --> 00:02:10.260
gutakaza amaraso, kwikuramo

27
00:02:10.260 --> 00:02:12.620
cyangwa kubura ibyo kurya.

28
00:02:12.620 --> 00:02:20.900
Retina irashobora kwangizwa na diyabete, inkovu zanduye cyangwa irashobora gutandukana.

29
00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:25.820
Muri iki gihe, kubaga umutima ntibishobora kunoza icyerekezo.

30
00:02:25.820 --> 00:02:33.100
Muncamake, mugihe usuzuma cataracte, fata amateka, igeragezwa rya visiografiya, reba kuri

31
00:02:33.100 --> 00:02:38.460
imbere yijisho kugirango yemeze cataracte kandi ukuyemo izindi ndwara.

32
00:02:38.460 --> 00:02:45.660
Reba kugirango urebe niba bipus izengurutse, umukara, igereranya kandi ititabira urumuri, kandi niba

33
00:02:45.660 --> 00:02:51.340
gushobora gukora ikizamini cyiza kandi ugasuzuma inyuma yijisho.
